## @file
#  Khadas VIM3 (Amlogic A311D / Synopsys DWC3) fork of MdeModulePkg XhciDxe.
#
#  Forked from edk2 b03a21a63e3bd001f52c527e5a57feddb53a690b so the reliability
#  fixes this controller needs can be maintained as first-class source instead
#  of an ever-growing patch file.  See README.md for the divergence list and for
#  how to rebase onto a newer upstream XhciDxe.
#
#  The XhciDxe driver is responsible for managing the behavior of XHCI controller.
#  It implements the interfaces of monitoring the status of all ports and transferring
#  Control, Bulk, Interrupt and Isochronous requests to those attached usb LS/FS/HS/SS devices.
#
